--- doc/manual/rw-FAQ.texi	(revision 90763)
+++ doc/manual/rw-FAQ.texi	(working copy)
@@ -1761,6 +1761,12 @@
 
 With a native build of R on ARM, exclude @file{\x64} from the above.
 
+R built with @I{FlexiBLAS} (@code{USE_FLEXIBLAS = YES} in
+@file{src/gnuwin32/MkRules.local}) can switch the BLAS and LAPACK
+at run time instead: set the environment variable @env{FLEXIBLAS},
+for example to @code{OPENBLAS}, before starting R, or change the
+default in @file{R_HOME\etc\flexiblasrc}.
